WEBVTT

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:49.420
Earthquake!

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.490
Run!

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.960
The mine's collapsing!

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.720
Run!

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:04.730
It's collapsing!

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:09.310
Run! It's collapsing!

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:12.430
Run! It's collapsing!

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:13.310
Run!

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:58.670
Witch!

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:01.440
You're a witch!

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:28.000
Die, you filthy witch!

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:29.850
Die!

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:32.660
She's just a young girl.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:33.820
Who would've thought...

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.310
Burn her to death!

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:41.510
Damn the witch!

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.420
His Highness is truly busy!

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:50.620
He doesn't even have time
to render a verdict.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:53.240
Carter, do you think

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.270
His Highness will get out of bed this time?

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:04.170
Well, our Border Town is remote
and sparsely populated,

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:06.060
and with a witch causing trouble,

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.390
His Highness probably
doesn't want to stay long.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.540
We should hurry back to Graycastle.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.230
Tyre.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.670
Lord Barov.

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:27.560
Where is His Highness?

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:30.660
His Highness... is still asleep.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:33.940
Your Highness.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.090
Your Highness.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.440
Y-Your Highness.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.520
Your Highness, it's time.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.050
Your Highness.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:02.990
Your Highness.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:06.100
Your Highness, wake up! Wake up!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.210
Your Highness.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.430
Your Highness.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.190
Where am I—

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.290
It's time for the witch's execution.

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.260
Everyone is waiting for your verdict.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:23.770
Verdict?

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:25.860
What verdict?

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:28.160
Am I dreaming?

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.270
Your Highness.

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:32.570
This... This feels so real!

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.310
Your Highness.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:40.180
You...

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:42.310
You...

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:45.990
Your Highness.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.520
Are you all right?

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:54.590
Barov.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.370
Your name is Barov.

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.680
Yes, Your Highness.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:03.750
Yes, it's me, your servant Barov.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.670
Your Highness, it's time for the execution.

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:07.940
Let's go out.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.600
Let's observe the situation for now.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.390
Your Highness, what's wrong?

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:33.130
Your Highness, let's go now.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:35.770
What on earth have I been through?

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:44.940
His Highness the Prince is coming out!

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:18.380
Prince!

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:20.020
Silence!

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.310
Hang her! Hang her!

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.870
W-Witch?

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:43.100
Your Highness, please give your verdict quickly.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:46.230
Is she... the witch you're talking about?

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.800
Yes, Your Highness.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.310
Witch hunts...

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.340
No... this is too absurd.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.950
I'm tired. Postpone the verdict.
Everyone is dismissed for today.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:06:59.540
Your Highness.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.420
Your Highness, this is not a joke.

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:04.900
Once a witch is identified,
she should be executed immediately.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.990
Otherwise, it will attract other witches.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:10.180
Carter... Lannis.

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.270
Yes, Your Highness.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:16.560
My... Chief Knight.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:17.260
Yes.

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:20.870
You're not afraid, right?

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:23.700
Isn't it better for a few more witches
to come so we can catch them all at once?

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:25.730
But...

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:36.820
Your Highness, why not hang the witch?

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:09.950
An unreliable prince.

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:12.520
An insignificant territory.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.240
An uncivilized society.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:18.440
A dark and ignorant era.

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:22.800
A sudden battle for the throne.

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:28.960
What can I possibly do...
in this chaotic world?

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:57.260
Since I'm here, I'll make the best of it.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:05.280
From this day on,

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:08.700
I am Roland Wimbledon.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.590
Good morning, Your Highness.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:19.040
Your Highness, you summoned me?

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:21.570
Barov, have a seat.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.420
Thank you.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:36.480
Your Highness, why didn't you
order the execution yesterday?

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:39.070
This matter is of grave importance.
It cannot be delayed.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.760
Oh? Why is that?

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:45.950
Guards reported sightings of
suspected witches in the western forest.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:48.110
They found this there.

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:51.090
The Insignia of the
Sacred Mountain and Magic Eye.

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:54.010
It's the emblem of the
Witch Cooperation Association.

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:56.600
The Witch Cooperation Association?
What's that?

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:58.850
An organization of witches.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:02.060
Before it was formed, witches acted alone.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.500
But the Association is different.

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.990
It wants to unite all witches

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.390
to search for the so-called Holy Mountain.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.390
You said... the Holy Mountain?

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:16.000
Rumor has it that they can only find eternal
peace by going to the Holy Mountain.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:20.700
For this purpose, the Association even
actively lures others into becoming witches.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:23.810
Didn't a group of baby girls go missing
from the Port of Clearwater last year?

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:25.940
Rumor has it that they were behind it.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:30.360
You're afraid the Association will hear
she didn't die, and come to rescue her.

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:32.450
Precisely, Your Highness.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:34.520
Those lunatics would even steal babies.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.190
They probably wouldn't
abandon a fallen comrade.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:40.430
Your Highness, you must
execute that witch quickly.

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.060
It'd be a problem if she
attracted her companions.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:47.040
Once someone becomes a witch,
she gains terrifying power.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:50.250
Even knights would struggle to match her.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:51.740
You mentioned power.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.100
What kind of power?

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:55.650
And how did you catch her?

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:58.520
A few days ago,
the North Slope Mine collapsed.

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:01.610
She used witchcraft and exposed her identity.

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:02.940
What kind of witchcraft?

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:06.260
She unleashed hellfire

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.940
and burnt a man to death.

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:10.310
The victim melted like wax,

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:14.440
with his head and most of his
body all over the ground.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:17.630
You wouldn't want to see something like that.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:21.620
So, Your Highness, let's deal with
that witch as soon as possible.

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:23.300
Take me to see her.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:24.440
Wh-What?

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.730
You want to see the witch?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:28.550
That's right.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:31.680
Your Highness!

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:33.840
Your Highness.

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:36.070
Wait, wait, Your Highness.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.120
But why death by hanging?

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:46.630
Isn't burning at the stake the
usual way of executing witches?

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:47.440
Is that so?

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:51.440
But she's not afraid of fire.

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.060
Your Highness, this is far too dangerous.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:57.160
We're dealing with an evil witch.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:14:00.690
Even though she's bound by God's Locket of
Retribution, we can't guarantee it's safe.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:04.040
If you can't face evil,
then how can you defeat it?

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:07.080
I thought my Chief Knight
understood this principle.

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:08.680
You must act within your capabilities.

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.110
Recklessness is not bravery.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:13.320
So you're saying we should uphold
justice against weaker foes,

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:15.680
but ignore stronger ones?

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.760
No, Your Highness. That's not what I meant.

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.530
Relax, Carter. Stand down.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.060
But, Your Highness...

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:32.860
What's your name?

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:35.100
I am the Lord of Border Town,

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.960
the Fourth Prince of the Kingdom
of Graycastle, Roland Wimbledon.

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.980
What's your name?

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:42.980
My name is Anna.

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:46.310
Miss Anna, what happened
in the mine that day?

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:48.480
I'd like you to tell me in detail.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.860
My father is a miner.

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:59.840
When the mine collapsed,
he was working inside.

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:03.010
I ran into the mine to find him.

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:04.980
Because of the collapse,

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.760
my father's leg was trapped
under the fallen rocks.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.480
Another miner who escaped with him

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:13.970
tried to steal the few coins he had on him.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.940
Those were my father's life savings,

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:21.480
our entire livelihood.

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:25.850
So my father fought back
with all his strength.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:28.850
When I found them,

00:16:28.850 --> 00:16:33.550
I saw the miner with his pickaxe raised,
about to kill my father.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:39.310
So I... killed him.

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:45.280
Then how were you captured?

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:48.800
Someone... reported me.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:51.190
Reported? Who reported you?

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.420
It was her father, Your Highness.

00:16:58.420 --> 00:16:59.230
What?

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.900
You said it was her father who reported her?

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:07.770
Probably for the bounty.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.120
Those who discover and report witches

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:12.750
receive a reward of 25 gold royals.

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.720
For someone with a broken leg,

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:17.910
that's enough to secure the rest of his life.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:23.340
He was a grown man.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:25.510
How did you kill him?

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:29.810
It was what you call...

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:32.080
the power of the devil.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:34.730
Really? The power of the devil.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:36.050
Can you show me?

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:37.740
Your Highness!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:41.490
Your Highness, she's currently being
suppressed by God's Stone of Retaliation.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.140
If she's released, the consequences
will be unimaginable.

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:46.790
Is this your first time
meeting a witch, Lord?

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:50.750
Your curiosity might kill you.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:54.390
If you truly are an evil devil,
then it shouldn't be me who dies.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.170
It should be your father.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.490
Your Highness. Your Highness!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:12.020
Your Highness, what are you doing?

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:13.940
Your Highness!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.080
Your Highness, what are you doing?

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:22.090
Come on.

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.990
Are you really a pitiful girl,

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:27.730
or are you a devil with
superb acting skills?

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:29.660
Let me see.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.140
Your Highness!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.540
Your Highness, let's get out of here!

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.730
No, Carter!

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.170
Wait, look!

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:01.980
What's there to see?

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:03.480
The flames...

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:05.210
The flames aren't coming out.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.920
She's consciously controlling the flames.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:11.980
She's not going to hurt us.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:18.730
Your Highness!

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:19.850
Your Highness!

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:59.810
Lord, has your curiosity been satisfied?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:03.310
Can you kill me now?

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:24.390
No, Miss Anna.

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:27.170
I want to hire you.